<title>PORTUGAL: Escudo ends calm vs mark, seen steady.</title>
<headline>Escudo ends calm vs mark, seen steady.</headline>
<text>
<p>1647 GMT - The escudo ended steady against the mark after an uneventful session. The Portuguese currency traded in a range between 100.99 and 101.02 per mark. Dealers said they expected the flat trend to continue as other southern European currencies were indifferent to the stronger dollar.</p>
</text>
